@startuml
title Queue Management Platform — Service Completion Sequence

actor "Service Provider" as Provider

participant "Application Service" as App
participant "Current Ticket" as Current
participant "Queue" as Queue
participant "Next Ticket" as Next

Provider -> App : FinishAndStartNext

App -> Current : Verify status = IN_SERVICE
App -> Current : Set completedAt
App -> Current : IN_SERVICE → COMPLETED

note right of App
Completion and next-ticket selection form one coherent business operation.

Queue ordering must remain protected during the operation.
end note

App -> Queue : Select next eligible candidate

Queue -> Queue : Consider WAITING / CONFIRMED
Queue -> Queue : Priority group first
Queue -> Queue : Position ASC

Queue --> App : Next candidate

alt Candidate exists

    App -> Next : Verify physical presence

    alt Customer present

        App -> Next : WAITING/CONFIRMED → IN_SERVICE
        App -> Next : Set inServiceAt

        App --> Provider : Next service started

    else Customer absent

        App -> Next : WAITING/CONFIRMED → SKIPPED

        alt Reinsertion allowed

            App -> Queue : Reinsert ticket
            Queue -> Next : Assign new group position
            Queue --> App : Ticket reinserted

            App -> Next : SKIPPED → WAITING

        else Reinsertion not allowed

            note right of Next
            Ticket remains SKIPPED.

            No further notification is triggered when notificationAttempts = 2.
            end note

        end

    end

else No candidate

    App --> Provider : Queue has no eligible candidate

end

@enduml